('234f9d7c-c49e-5335-8a06-208b22f9b156'::uuid, 1, 18, 18, 18, 'द्रुपदो द्रौपदेयाश्च सर्वशः पृथिवीपते।

सौभद्रश्च महाबाहुः शङ्खान्दध्मुः पृथक्पृथक्।।1.18।।', 'drupado draupadeyāśhcha sarvaśhaḥ pṛithivī-pate
saubhadraśhcha mahā-bāhuḥ śhaṅkhāndadhmuḥ pṛithak pṛithak', '[{"word":"drupadaḥ","meaning":"Drupad"},{"word":"draupadeyāḥ","meaning":"the five sons of Draupadi"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"sarvaśhaḥ","meaning":"all"},{"word":"pṛithivī","meaning":"pate—Ruler of the earth"},{"word":"saubhadraḥ","meaning":"Abhimanyu, the son of Subhadra"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"also"},{"word":"mahā","meaning":"bāhuḥ—the mighty-armed"},{"word":"śhaṅkhān","meaning":"conch shells"},{"word":"dadhmuḥ","meaning":"blew"},{"word":"pṛithak pṛithak","meaning":"individually"}]'::jsonb, 'drupadaḥ—Drupad; draupadeyāḥ—the five sons of Draupadi; cha—and; sarvaśhaḥ—all; pṛithivī-pate—Ruler of the earth; saubhadraḥ—Abhimanyu, the son of Subhadra; cha—also; mahā-bāhuḥ—the mighty-armed; śhaṅkhān—conch shells; dadhmuḥ—blew; pṛithak pṛithak—individually'),
('3bdd5706-9362-5eeb-a3a2-939ae47857b8'::uuid, 1, 19, 19, 19, 'स घोषो धार्तराष्ट्राणां हृदयानि व्यदारयत्।

नभश्च पृथिवीं चैव तुमुलो व्यनुनादयन्।।1.19।।', 'sa ghoṣho dhārtarāṣhṭrāṇāṁ hṛidayāni vyadārayat
nabhaśhcha pṛithivīṁ chaiva tumulo nunādayan', '[{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"that"},{"word":"ghoṣhaḥ","meaning":"sound"},{"word":"dhārtarāṣhṭrāṇām","meaning":"of Dhritarashtra’s sons"},{"word":"hṛidayāni","meaning":"hearts"},{"word":"vyadārayat","meaning":"shattered"},{"word":"nabhaḥ","meaning":"the sky"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"pṛithivīm","meaning":"the earth"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"tumulaḥ","meaning":"terrific sound"},{"word":"abhyanunādayan","meaning":"thundering"}]'::jsonb, 'saḥ—that; ghoṣhaḥ—sound; dhārtarāṣhṭrāṇām—of Dhritarashtra’s sons; hṛidayāni—hearts; vyadārayat—shattered; nabhaḥ—the sky; cha—and; pṛithivīm—the earth; cha—and; eva—certainly; tumulaḥ—terrific sound; abhyanunādayan—thundering'),
('e0ee1743-eea8-5d6b-b0e2-116b2075c06e'::uuid, 1, 20, 20, 20, 'अथ व्यवस्थितान् दृष्ट्वा धार्तराष्ट्रान्कपिध्वजः।

प्रवृत्ते शस्त्रसंपाते धनुरुद्यम्य पाण्डवः।।1.20।।', 'atha vyavasthitān dṛiṣhṭvā dhārtarāṣhṭrān kapi-dhwajaḥ
pravṛitte śhastra-sampāte dhanurudyamya pāṇḍavaḥ
hṛiṣhīkeśhaṁ tadā vākyam idam āha mahī-pate', '[{"word":"atha","meaning":"thereupon"},{"word":"vyavasthitān","meaning":"arrayed"},{"word":"dṛiṣhṭvā","meaning":"seeing"},{"word":"dhārtarāṣhṭrān","meaning":"Dhritarashtra’s sons"},{"word":"kapi","meaning":"dwajaḥ—the Monkey Bannered"},{"word":"pravṛitte","meaning":"about to commence"},{"word":"śhastra","meaning":"sampāte—to use the weapons"},{"word":"dhanuḥ","meaning":"bow"},{"word":"udyamya","meaning":"taking up"},{"word":"pāṇḍavaḥ","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pandu"},{"word":"hṛiṣhīkeśham","meaning":"to Shree Krishna"},{"word":"tadā","meaning":"at that time"},{"word":"vākyam","meaning":"words"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"these"},{"word":"āha","meaning":"said"},{"word":"mahī","meaning":"pate—King"}]'::jsonb, 'atha—thereupon; vyavasthitān—arrayed; dṛiṣhṭvā—seeing; dhārtarāṣhṭrān—Dhritarashtra’s sons; kapi-dwajaḥ—the Monkey Bannered; pravṛitte—about to commence; śhastra-sampāte—to use the weapons; dhanuḥ—bow; udyamya—taking up; pāṇḍavaḥ—Arjun, the son of Pandu; hṛiṣhīkeśham—to Shree Krishna; tadā—at that time; vākyam—words; idam—these; āha—said; mahī-pate—King'),
('0dacaed8-ac46-54ac-96b3-2419fa05dac9'::uuid, 1, 21, 21, 21, 'अर्जुन उवाच

हृषीकेशं तदा वाक्यमिदमाह महीपते।

सेनयोरुभयोर्मध्ये रथं स्थापय मेऽच्युत।।1.21।।', 'arjuna uvācha
senayor ubhayor madhye rathaṁ sthāpaya me ’chyuta', '[{"word":"arjunaḥ uvācha","meaning":"Arjun said"},{"word":"senayoḥ","meaning":"armies"},{"word":"ubhayoḥ","meaning":"both"},{"word":"madhye","meaning":"in the middle"},{"word":"ratham","meaning":"chariot"},{"word":"sthāpaya","meaning":"place"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"achyuta","meaning":"Shree Krishna, the infallible One"}]'::jsonb, 'arjunaḥ uvācha—Arjun said; senayoḥ—armies; ubhayoḥ—both; madhye—in the middle; ratham—chariot; sthāpaya—place; me—my; achyuta—Shree Krishna, the infallible One;'),
('deaf76ac-eb32-5174-a19f-0452e6b8a6e0'::uuid, 1, 22, 22, 22, 'यावदेतान्निरीक्षेऽहं योद्धुकामानवस्थितान्।

कैर्मया सह योद्धव्यमस्मिन्रणसमुद्यमे।।1.22।।', 'yāvadetān nirīkṣhe ’haṁ yoddhu-kāmān avasthitān
kairmayā saha yoddhavyam asmin raṇa-samudyame', '[{"word":"yāvat","meaning":"as many as"},{"word":"etān","meaning":"these"},{"word":"nirīkṣhe","meaning":"look"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"yoddhu","meaning":"kāmān—for the battle"},{"word":"avasthitān","meaning":"arrayed"},{"word":"kaiḥ","meaning":"with whom"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"saha","meaning":"together"},{"word":"yoddhavyam","meaning":"must fight"},{"word":"asmin","meaning":"in this"},{"word":"raṇa","meaning":"samudyame—great combat"}]'::jsonb, 'yāvat—as many as; etān—these; nirīkṣhe—look; aham—I; yoddhu-kāmān—for the battle; avasthitān—arrayed; kaiḥ—with whom; mayā—by me; saha—together; yoddhavyam—must fight; asmin—in this; raṇa-samudyame—great combat'),
('4acb1945-35fe-5330-8199-ecb8441a19b5'::uuid, 1, 23, 23, 23, 'योत्स्यमानानवेक्षेऽहं य एतेऽत्र समागताः।

धार्तराष्ट्रस्य दुर्बुद्धेर्युद्धे प्रियचिकीर्षवः।।1.23।।', 'yotsyamānān avekṣhe ’haṁ ya ete ’tra samāgatāḥ
dhārtarāṣhṭrasya durbuddher yuddhe priya-chikīrṣhavaḥ', '[{"word":"yotsyamānān","meaning":"those who have come to fight"},{"word":"avekṣhe aham","meaning":"I desire to see"},{"word":"ye","meaning":"who"},{"word":"ete","meaning":"those"},{"word":"atra","meaning":"here"},{"word":"samāgatāḥ","meaning":"assembled"},{"word":"dhārtarāṣhṭrasya","meaning":"of Dhritarashtra’s son"},{"word":"durbuddheḥ","meaning":"evil-minded"},{"word":"yuddhe","meaning":"in the fight"},{"word":"priya","meaning":"chikīrṣhavaḥ—wishing to please"}]'::jsonb, 'yotsyamānān—those who have come to fight; avekṣhe aham—I desire to see; ye—who; ete—those; atra—here; samāgatāḥ—assembled; dhārtarāṣhṭrasya—of Dhritarashtra’s son; durbuddheḥ—evil-minded; yuddhe—in the fight; priya-chikīrṣhavaḥ—wishing to please'),
('f141f7b5-6dd9-56de-95c4-e6b02878d9c6'::uuid, 1, 24, 24, 24, 'संजय उवाच

एवमुक्तो हृषीकेशो गुडाकेशेन भारत।

सेनयोरुभयोर्मध्ये स्थापयित्वा रथोत्तमम्।।1.24।।', 'sañjaya uvācha
evam ukto hṛiṣhīkeśho guḍākeśhena bhārata
senayor ubhayor madhye sthāpayitvā rathottamam', '[{"word":"sañjayaḥ uvācha","meaning":"Sanjay said"},{"word":"evam","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"uktaḥ","meaning":"addressed"},{"word":"hṛiṣhīkeśhaḥ","meaning":"Shree Krishna, the Lord of the senses"},{"word":"guḍākeśhena","meaning":"by Arjun, the conqueror of sleep"},{"word":"bhārata","meaning":"descendant of Bharat"},{"word":"senayoḥ","meaning":"armies"},{"word":"ubhayoḥ","meaning":"the two"},{"word":"madhye","meaning":"between"},{"word":"sthāpayitvā","meaning":"having drawn"},{"word":"ratha","meaning":"uttamam—magnificent chariot"}]'::jsonb, 'sañjayaḥ uvācha—Sanjay said; evam—thus; uktaḥ—addressed; hṛiṣhīkeśhaḥ—Shree Krishna, the Lord of the senses; guḍākeśhena—by Arjun, the conqueror of sleep; bhārata—descendant of Bharat; senayoḥ—armies; ubhayoḥ—the two; madhye—between; sthāpayitvā—having drawn; ratha-uttamam—magnificent chariot'),
('0dd87316-617e-5142-acda-5a76e2614ee8'::uuid, 1, 25, 25, 25, 'भीष्मद्रोणप्रमुखतः सर्वेषां च महीक्षिताम्।

उवाच पार्थ पश्यैतान्समवेतान्कुरूनिति।।1.25।।', 'bhīṣhma-droṇa-pramukhataḥ sarveṣhāṁ cha mahī-kṣhitām
