('3857fad2-c141-5c9b-8a2e-a9ea92bd6617'::uuid, 7, 1, 281, 281, 'श्री भगवानुवाच

मय्यासक्तमनाः पार्थ योगं युञ्जन्मदाश्रयः।

असंशयं समग्रं मां यथा ज्ञास्यसि तच्छृणु।।7.1।।', 'śhrī bhagavān uvācha
mayyāsakta-manāḥ pārtha yogaṁ yuñjan mad-āśhrayaḥ
asanśhayaṁ samagraṁ māṁ yathā jñāsyasi tach chhṛiṇu', '[{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said"},{"word":"mayi","meaning":"to me"},{"word":"āsakta","meaning":"manāḥ—with the mind attached"},{"word":"pārtha","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pritha"},{"word":"yogam","meaning":"bhakti yog"},{"word":"yuñjan","meaning":"practicing"},{"word":"mat","meaning":"āśhrayaḥ—surrendering to me"},{"word":"asanśhayam","meaning":"free from doubt"},{"word":"samagram","meaning":"completely"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"yathā","meaning":"how"},{"word":"jñāsyasi","meaning":"you shall know"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"śhṛiṇu","meaning":"listen"}]'::jsonb, 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said; mayi—to me; āsakta-manāḥ—with the mind attached; pārtha—Arjun, the son of Pritha; yogam—bhakti yog; yuñjan—practicing; mat-āśhrayaḥ—surrendering to me; asanśhayam—free from doubt; samagram—completely; mām—me; yathā—how; jñāsyasi—you shall know; tat—that; śhṛiṇu—listen'),
('c59ebaaa-4cad-5a24-b61a-63b45113e007'::uuid, 7, 2, 282, 282, 'ज्ञानं तेऽहं सविज्ञानमिदं वक्ष्याम्यशेषतः।

यज्ज्ञात्वा नेह भूयोऽन्यज्ज्ञातव्यमवशिष्यते।।7.2।।', 'jñānaṁ te ’haṁ sa-vijñānam idaṁ vakṣhyāmyaśheṣhataḥ
yaj jñātvā neha bhūyo ’nyaj jñātavyam-avaśhiṣhyate', '[{"word":"jñānam","meaning":"knowledge"},{"word":"te","meaning":"unto you"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"sa","meaning":"with"},{"word":"vijñānam","meaning":"wisdom"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"vakṣhyāmi","meaning":"shall reveal"},{"word":"aśheṣhataḥ","meaning":"in full"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"jñātvā","meaning":"having known"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"iha","meaning":"in this world"},{"word":"bhūyaḥ","meaning":"further"},{"word":"anyat","meaning":"anything else"},{"word":"jñātavyam","meaning":"to be known"},{"word":"avaśhiṣhyate","meaning":"remains"}]'::jsonb, 'jñānam—knowledge; te—unto you; aham—I; sa—with; vijñānam—wisdom; idam—this; vakṣhyāmi—shall reveal; aśheṣhataḥ—in full; yat—which; jñātvā—having known; na—not; iha—in this world; bhūyaḥ—further; anyat—anything else; jñātavyam—to be known; avaśhiṣhyate—remains'),
('8a7c9bb0-7762-5d86-b4ca-3bafe4883617'::uuid, 7, 3, 283, 283, 'मनुष्याणां सहस्रेषु कश्िचद्यतति सिद्धये।

यततामपि सिद्धानां कश्िचन्मां वेत्ति तत्त्वतः।।7.3।।', 'manuṣhyāṇāṁ sahasreṣhu kaśhchid yatati siddhaye
yatatām api siddhānāṁ kaśhchin māṁ vetti tattvataḥ', '[{"word":"manuṣhyāṇām","meaning":"of men"},{"word":"sahasreṣhu","meaning":"out of many thousands"},{"word":"kaśhchit","meaning":"someone"},{"word":"yatati","meaning":"strives"},{"word":"siddhaye","meaning":"for perfection"},{"word":"yatatām","meaning":"of those who strive"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"siddhānām","meaning":"of those who have achieved perfection"},{"word":"kaśhchit","meaning":"someone"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"vetti","meaning":"knows"},{"word":"tattvataḥ","meaning":"in truth"}]'::jsonb, 'manuṣhyāṇām—of men; sahasreṣhu—out of many thousands; kaśhchit—someone; yatati—strives; siddhaye—for perfection; yatatām—of those who strive; api—even; siddhānām—of those who have achieved perfection; kaśhchit—someone; mām—me; vetti—knows; tattvataḥ—in truth'),
('8e33ba3b-74b3-5655-9413-3bdbf30af51d'::uuid, 7, 4, 284, 284, 'भूमिरापोऽनलो वायुः खं मनो बुद्धिरेव च।

अहङ्कार इतीयं मे भिन्ना प्रकृतिरष्टधा।।7.4।।', 'bhūmir-āpo ’nalo vāyuḥ khaṁ mano buddhir eva cha
ahankāra itīyaṁ me bhinnā prakṛitir aṣhṭadhā', '[{"word":"bhūmiḥ","meaning":"earth"},{"word":"āpaḥ","meaning":"water"},{"word":"analaḥ","meaning":"fire"},{"word":"vāyuḥ","meaning":"air"},{"word":"kham","meaning":"space"},{"word":"manaḥ","meaning":"mind"},{"word":"buddhiḥ","meaning":"intellect"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"ahankāraḥ","meaning":"ego"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"iyam","meaning":"all these"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"bhinnā","meaning":"divisions"},{"word":"prakṛitiḥ","meaning":"material energy"},{"word":"aṣhṭadhā","meaning":"eightfold"}]'::jsonb, 'bhūmiḥ—earth; āpaḥ—water; analaḥ—fire; vāyuḥ—air; kham—space; manaḥ—mind; buddhiḥ—intellect; eva—certainly; cha—and; ahankāraḥ—ego; iti—thus; iyam—all these; me—my; bhinnā—divisions; prakṛitiḥ—material energy; aṣhṭadhā—eightfold'),
('50cb55eb-fe26-5ff0-b8e9-05af6bd0eddb'::uuid, 7, 5, 285, 285, 'अपरेयमितस्त्वन्यां प्रकृतिं विद्धि मे पराम्।

जीवभूतां महाबाहो ययेदं धार्यते जगत्।।7.5।।', 'apareyam itas tvanyāṁ prakṛitiṁ viddhi me parām
