('db488ea7-8b3f-5c9a-ad38-9b161f25d24a'::uuid, 9, 14, 352, 352, 'सततं कीर्तयन्तो मां यतन्तश्च दृढव्रताः।

नमस्यन्तश्च मां भक्त्या नित्ययुक्ता उपासते।।9.14।।', 'satataṁ kīrtayanto māṁ yatantaśh cha dṛiḍha-vratāḥ
namasyantaśh cha māṁ bhaktyā nitya-yuktā upāsate', '[{"word":"satatam","meaning":"always"},{"word":"kīrtayantaḥ","meaning":"singing divine glories"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"yatantaḥ","meaning":"striving"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"dṛiḍha","meaning":"vratāḥ—with great determination"},{"word":"namasyantaḥ","meaning":"humbly bowing down"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"bhaktyā","meaning":"loving devotion"},{"word":"nitya","meaning":"yuktāḥ—constantly united"},{"word":"upāsate","meaning":"worship"}]'::jsonb, 'satatam—always; kīrtayantaḥ—singing divine glories; mām—me; yatantaḥ—striving; cha—and; dṛiḍha-vratāḥ—with great determination; namasyantaḥ—humbly bowing down; cha—and; mām—me; bhaktyā—loving devotion; nitya-yuktāḥ—constantly united; upāsate—worship'),
('2b102cad-2dba-5c60-ae6a-aab71303d17d'::uuid, 9, 15, 353, 353, 'ज्ञानयज्ञेन चाप्यन्ये यजन्तो मामुपासते।

एकत्वेन पृथक्त्वेन बहुधा विश्वतोमुखम्।।9.15।।', 'jñāna-yajñena chāpyanye yajanto mām upāsate
