('58c335af-6a9f-52bb-8a45-2ac5c1f1635a'::uuid, 10, 27, 399, 399, 'उच्चैःश्रवसमश्वानां विद्धि माममृतोद्भवम्।

ऐरावतं गजेन्द्राणां नराणां च नराधिपम्।।10.27।।', 'uchchaiḥśhravasam aśhvānāṁ viddhi mām amṛitodbhavam
airāvataṁ gajendrāṇāṁ narāṇāṁ cha narādhipam', '[{"word":"uchchaiḥśhravasam","meaning":"Uchchaihshrava"},{"word":"aśhvānām","meaning":"amongst horses"},{"word":"viddhi","meaning":"know"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"amṛita","meaning":"udbhavam—begotten from the churning of the ocean of nectar"},{"word":"airāvatam","meaning":"Airavata"},{"word":"gaja","meaning":"indrāṇām—amongst all lordly elephants"},{"word":"narāṇām","meaning":"amongst humans"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"nara","meaning":"adhipam—the king"}]'::jsonb, 'uchchaiḥśhravasam—Uchchaihshrava; aśhvānām—amongst horses; viddhi—know; mām—me; amṛita-udbhavam—begotten from the churning of the ocean of nectar; airāvatam—Airavata; gaja-indrāṇām—amongst all lordly elephants; narāṇām—amongst humans; cha—and; nara-adhipam—the king'),
('23b7055f-24f3-509d-b448-330bdd266df7'::uuid, 10, 28, 400, 400, 'आयुधानामहं वज्रं धेनूनामस्मि कामधुक्।

प्रजनश्चास्मि कन्दर्पः सर्पाणामस्मि वासुकिः।।10.28।।', 'āyudhānām ahaṁ vajraṁ dhenūnām asmi kāmadhuk
