('6bdfac75-31de-5c07-90b5-8c3ce0b1fd02'::uuid, 10, 29, 401, 401, 'अनन्तश्चास्मि नागानां वरुणो यादसामहम्।

पितृ़णामर्यमा चास्मि यमः संयमतामहम्।।10.29।।', 'anantaśh chāsmi nāgānāṁ varuṇo yādasām aham
pitṝīṇām aryamā chāsmi yamaḥ sanyamatām aham', '[{"word":"anantaḥ","meaning":"Anant"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"nāgānām","meaning":"amongst snakes"},{"word":"varuṇaḥ","meaning":"the celestial god of the ocean"},{"word":"yādasām","meaning":"amongst aquatics"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"pitṝīṇām","meaning":"amongst the departed ancestors"},{"word":"aryamā","meaning":"Aryama"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"am"},{"word":"yamaḥ","meaning":"the celestial god of death"},{"word":"sanyamatām","meaning":"amongst dispensers of law"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"}]'::jsonb, 'anantaḥ—Anant; cha—and; asmi—I am; nāgānām—amongst snakes; varuṇaḥ—the celestial god of the ocean; yādasām—amongst aquatics; aham—I; pitṝīṇām—amongst the departed ancestors; aryamā—Aryama; cha—and; asmi—am; yamaḥ—the celestial god of death; sanyamatām—amongst dispensers of law; aham—I'),
('8bd37472-41bd-5c14-933a-cbebce43a454'::uuid, 10, 30, 402, 402, 'प्रह्लादश्चास्मि दैत्यानां कालः कलयतामहम्।

मृगाणां च मृगेन्द्रोऽहं वैनतेयश्च पक्षिणाम्।।10.30।।', 'prahlādaśh chāsmi daityānāṁ kālaḥ kalayatām aham
