('12953804-97f5-598a-88cc-cd9b22fd31f6'::uuid, 10, 32, 404, 404, 'सर्गाणामादिरन्तश्च मध्यं चैवाहमर्जुन।

अध्यात्मविद्या विद्यानां वादः प्रवदतामहम्।।10.32।।', 'sargāṇām ādir antaśh cha madhyaṁ chaivāham arjuna
adhyātma-vidyā vidyānāṁ vādaḥ pravadatām aham', '[{"word":"sargāṇām","meaning":"of all creations"},{"word":"ādiḥ","meaning":"the beginning"},{"word":"antaḥ","meaning":"end"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"madhyam","meaning":"middle"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"indeed"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"},{"word":"adhyātma","meaning":"vidyā—science of spirituality"},{"word":"vidyānām","meaning":"amongst sciences"},{"word":"vādaḥ","meaning":"the logical conclusion"},{"word":"pravadatām","meaning":"of debates"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"}]'::jsonb, 'sargāṇām—of all creations; ādiḥ—the beginning; antaḥ—end; cha—and; madhyam—middle; cha—and; eva—indeed; aham—I; arjuna—Arjun; adhyātma-vidyā—science of spirituality; vidyānām—amongst sciences; vādaḥ—the logical conclusion; pravadatām—of debates; aham—I'),
('5c3d7487-717a-56fb-8db4-f9ecc1d7b01c'::uuid, 10, 33, 405, 405, 'अक्षराणामकारोऽस्मि द्वन्द्वः सामासिकस्य च।

अहमेवाक्षयः कालो धाताऽहं विश्वतोमुखः।।10.33।।', 'अहमेवाक्षय: कालो धाताहं विश्वतोमुख: || 33||

akṣharāṇām a-kāro ’smi dvandvaḥ sāmāsikasya cha
aham evākṣhayaḥ kālo dhātāhaṁ viśhvato-mukhaḥ', '[{"word":"akṣharāṇām","meaning":"amongst all letters"},{"word":"a","meaning":"kāraḥ—the beginning letter “A”"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"dvandvaḥ","meaning":"the dual"},{"word":"sāmāsikasya","meaning":"amongst grammatical compounds"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"only"},{"word":"akṣhayaḥ","meaning":"endless"},{"word":"kālaḥ","meaning":"time"},{"word":"dhātā","meaning":"amongst the creators"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"viśhwataḥ","meaning":"mukhaḥ—Brahma"}]'::jsonb, 'akṣharāṇām—amongst all letters; a-kāraḥ—the beginning letter “A”; asmi—I am; dvandvaḥ—the dual; sāmāsikasya—amongst grammatical compounds; cha—and; aham—I; eva—only; akṣhayaḥ—endless; kālaḥ—time; dhātā—amongst the creators; aham—I; viśhwataḥ-mukhaḥ—Brahma'),
('b57a7f41-b0d5-5605-91ae-956e0f0666d9'::uuid, 10, 34, 406, 406, 'मृत्युः सर्वहरश्चाहमुद्भवश्च भविष्यताम्।

कीर्तिः श्रीर्वाक्च नारीणां स्मृतिर्मेधा धृतिः क्षमा।।10.34।।', 'mṛityuḥ sarva-haraśh chāham udbhavaśh cha bhaviṣhyatām
kīrtiḥ śhrīr vāk cha nārīṇāṁ smṛitir medhā dhṛitiḥ kṣhamā', '[{"word":"mṛityuḥ","meaning":"death"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"haraḥ—all-devouring"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"udbhavaḥ","meaning":"the origin"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"bhaviṣhyatām","meaning":"those things that are yet to be"},{"word":"kīrtiḥ","meaning":"fame"},{"word":"śhrīḥ","meaning":"prospective"},{"word":"vāk","meaning":"fine speech"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"nārīṇām","meaning":"amongst feminine qualities"},{"word":"smṛitiḥ","meaning":"memory"},{"word":"medhā","meaning":"intelligence"},{"word":"dhṛitiḥ","meaning":"courage"},{"word":"kṣhamā","meaning":"forgiveness"}]'::jsonb, 'mṛityuḥ—death; sarva-haraḥ—all-devouring; cha—and; aham—I; udbhavaḥ—the origin; cha—and; bhaviṣhyatām—those things that are yet to be; kīrtiḥ—fame; śhrīḥ—prospective; vāk—fine speech; cha—and; nārīṇām—amongst feminine qualities; smṛitiḥ—memory; medhā—intelligence; dhṛitiḥ—courage; kṣhamā—forgiveness'),
('6e3af952-af6a-5e4d-9a10-bc856eca2039'::uuid, 10, 35, 407, 407, 'बृहत्साम तथा साम्नां गायत्री छन्दसामहम्।

मासानां मार्गशीर्षोऽहमृतूनां कुसुमाकरः।।10.35।।', 'bṛihat-sāma tathā sāmnāṁ gāyatrī chhandasām aham
