('fe70e8c1-a538-568d-af01-b03669e4ea9a'::uuid, 10, 36, 408, 408, 'द्यूतं छलयतामस्मि तेजस्तेजस्विनामहम्।

जयोऽस्मि व्यवसायोऽस्मि सत्त्वं सत्त्ववतामहम्।।10.36।।', 'dyūtaṁ chhalayatām asmi tejas tejasvinām aham
jayo ’smi vyavasāyo ’smi sattvaṁ sattvavatām aham', '[{"word":"dyūtam","meaning":"gambling"},{"word":"chhalayatām","meaning":"of all cheats"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"tejaḥ","meaning":"the splendor"},{"word":"tejasvinām","meaning":"of the splendid"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"jayaḥ","meaning":"victory"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"vyavasāyaḥ","meaning":"firm resolve"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"sattvam","meaning":"virtue"},{"word":"sattva","meaning":"vatām—of the virtuous"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"}]'::jsonb, 'dyūtam—gambling; chhalayatām—of all cheats; asmi—I am; tejaḥ—the splendor; tejasvinām—of the splendid; aham—I; jayaḥ—victory; asmi—I am; vyavasāyaḥ—firm resolve; asmi—I am; sattvam—virtue; sattva-vatām—of the virtuous; aham—I'),
('9c5da1f5-2d56-50dc-95e1-529f6974ec17'::uuid, 10, 37, 409, 409, 'वृष्णीनां वासुदेवोऽस्मि पाण्डवानां धनंजयः।

मुनीनामप्यहं व्यासः कवीनामुशना कविः।।10.37।।', 'vṛiṣhṇīnāṁ vāsudevo ’smi pāṇḍavānāṁ dhanañjayaḥ
