('76abbd73-3126-5417-8148-67094f760fe8'::uuid, 10, 38, 410, 410, 'दण्डो दमयतामस्मि नीतिरस्मि जिगीषताम्।

मौनं चैवास्मि गुह्यानां ज्ञानं ज्ञानवतामहम्।।10.38।।', 'daṇḍo damayatām asmi nītir asmi jigīṣhatām
maunaṁ chaivāsmi guhyānāṁ jñānaṁ jñānavatām aham', '[{"word":"daṇḍaḥ","meaning":"punishment"},{"word":"damayatām","meaning":"amongst means of preventing lawlessness"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"nītiḥ","meaning":"proper conduct"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"jigīṣhatām","meaning":"amongst those who seek victory"},{"word":"maunam","meaning":"silence"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"also"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"guhyānām","meaning":"amongst secrets"},{"word":"jñānam","meaning":"wisdom"},{"word":"jñāna","meaning":"vatām—in the wise"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"}]'::jsonb, 'daṇḍaḥ—punishment; damayatām—amongst means of preventing lawlessness; asmi—I am; nītiḥ—proper conduct; asmi—I am; jigīṣhatām—amongst those who seek victory; maunam—silence; cha—and; eva—also; asmi—I am; guhyānām—amongst secrets; jñānam—wisdom; jñāna-vatām—in the wise; aham—I'),
('22f05195-d61f-5fae-a530-c6fbeef36198'::uuid, 10, 39, 411, 411, 'यच्चापि सर्वभूतानां बीजं तदहमर्जुन।

न तदस्ति विना यत्स्यान्मया भूतं चराचरम्।।10.39।।', 'yach chāpi sarva-bhūtānāṁ bījaṁ tad aham arjuna
na tad asti vinā yat syān mayā bhūtaṁ charācharam', '[{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"api","meaning":"also"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"bhūtānām—of all living beings"},{"word":"bījam","meaning":"generating seed"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"asti","meaning":"is"},{"word":"vinā","meaning":"without"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"syāt","meaning":"may exist"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"me"},{"word":"bhūtam","meaning":"creature"},{"word":"chara","meaning":"acharam—moving and nonmoving"}]'::jsonb, 'yat—which; cha—and; api—also; sarva-bhūtānām—of all living beings; bījam—generating seed; tat—that; aham—I; arjuna—Arjun; na—not; tat—that; asti—is; vinā—without; yat—which; syāt—may exist; mayā—me; bhūtam—creature; chara-acharam—moving and nonmoving'),
('e4da816e-b9e0-5b44-ab42-4ed2171ac57a'::uuid, 10, 40, 412, 412, 'नान्तोऽस्ति मम दिव्यानां विभूतीनां परंतप।

एष तूद्देशतः प्रोक्तो विभूतेर्विस्तरो मया।।10.40।।', 'nānto ’sti mama divyānāṁ vibhūtīnāṁ parantapa
eṣha tūddeśhataḥ prokto vibhūter vistaro mayā', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"antaḥ","meaning":"end"},{"word":"asti","meaning":"is"},{"word":"mama","meaning":"my"},{"word":"divyānām","meaning":"divine"},{"word":"vibhūtīnām","meaning":"manifestations"},{"word":"parantapa","meaning":"Arjun, the conqueror of the enemies"},{"word":"eṣhaḥ","meaning":"this"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"uddeśhataḥ","meaning":"just one portion"},{"word":"proktaḥ","meaning":"declared"},{"word":"vibhūteḥ","meaning":"of (my) glories"},{"word":"vistaraḥ","meaning":"the breath of the topic"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; antaḥ—end; asti—is; mama—my; divyānām—divine; vibhūtīnām—manifestations; parantapa—Arjun, the conqueror of the enemies; eṣhaḥ—this; tu—but; uddeśhataḥ—just one portion; proktaḥ—declared; vibhūteḥ—of (my) glories; vistaraḥ—the breath of the topic; mayā—by me'),
('5eac06b9-a790-5427-9d94-84be18f94cb8'::uuid, 10, 41, 413, 413, 'यद्यद्विभूतिमत्सत्त्वं श्रीमदूर्जितमेव वा।

तत्तदेवावगच्छ त्वं मम तेजोंऽशसंभवम्।।10.41।।', 'yad yad vibhūtimat sattvaṁ śhrīmad ūrjitam eva vā
tat tad evāvagachchha tvaṁ mama tejo ’nśha-sambhavam', '[{"word":"yat yat","meaning":"whatever"},{"word":"vibhūtimat","meaning":"opulent"},{"word":"sattvam","meaning":"being"},{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"mat—beautiful"},{"word":"ūrjitam","meaning":"glorious"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"also"},{"word":"vā","meaning":"or"},{"word":"tat tat","meaning":"all that"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"only"},{"word":"avagachchha","meaning":"know"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"mama","meaning":"my"},{"word":"tejaḥ","meaning":"anśha-sambhavam—splendor"},{"word":"anśha","meaning":"a part"},{"word":"sambhavam","meaning":"born of"}]'::jsonb, 'yat yat—whatever; vibhūtimat—opulent; sattvam—being; śhrī-mat—beautiful; ūrjitam—glorious; eva—also; vā—or; tat tat—all that; eva—only; avagachchha—know; tvam—you; mama—my; tejaḥ-anśha-sambhavam—splendor; anśha—a part; sambhavam—born of'),
('f41b38d6-776c-5e3e-978d-48b6244fc84d'::uuid, 10, 42, 414, 414, 'अथवा बहुनैतेन किं ज्ञातेन तवार्जुन।

विष्टभ्याहमिदं कृत्स्नमेकांशेन स्थितो जगत्।।10.42।।', 'atha vā bahunaitena kiṁ jñātena tavārjuna
