('662847cf-2d99-5e79-9022-b3a15c40d737'::uuid, 11, 27, 441, 441, 'वक्त्राणि ते त्वरमाणा विशन्ति

दंष्ट्राकरालानि भयानकानि।

केचिद्विलग्ना दशनान्तरेषु

संदृश्यन्ते चूर्णितैरुत्तमाङ्गैः।।11.27।।', 'vaktrāṇi te  tvaramāṇā   viśanti daṁṣṭrā-karālāni    bhayānakāni kecid   vilagnā daśanāntareṣu   sandṛśyante cūrṇitair   uttamāṅgaiḥ', '[{"word":"vaktrāṇi","meaning":"mouths"},{"word":"te","meaning":"Your"},{"word":"tvaramāṇāḥ","meaning":"fearful"},{"word":"viśanti","meaning":"entering"},{"word":"daṁṣṭrā","meaning":"teeth"},{"word":"karālāni","meaning":"terrible"},{"word":"bhayānakāni","meaning":"very    fearful"},{"word":"kecit","meaning":"some  of  them"},{"word":"vilagnāḥ","meaning":"being  attacked"},{"word":"daśanāntareṣu","meaning":"between   the teeth"},{"word":"sandṛśyante","meaning":"being   seen"},{"word":"cūrṇitaiḥ","meaning":"smashed"},{"word":"uttama","meaning":"aṅgaiḥ—by    the head"}]'::jsonb, 'vaktrāṇi—mouths;   te—Your;    tvaramāṇāḥ—fearful;     viśanti—entering;   daṁṣṭrā—teeth;  karālāni—terrible;  bhayānakāni—very    fearful;    kecit—some  of  them;   vilagnāḥ—being  attacked;   daśanāntareṣu—between   the teeth;  sandṛśyante—being   seen;   cūrṇitaiḥ—smashed;  uttama-aṅgaiḥ—by    the head'),
('8db8138e-ae14-5c0d-a9af-0a1e2250ab0b'::uuid, 11, 28, 442, 442, 'यथा नदीनां बहवोऽम्बुवेगाः

समुद्रमेवाभिमुखाः द्रवन्ति।

तथा तवामी नरलोकवीरा

विशन्ति वक्त्राण्यभिविज्वलन्ति।।11.28।।', 'yathā nadīnāṁ bahavo ’mbu-vegāḥ
