('a9beb7a3-faee-52fd-b68c-f425a866141a'::uuid, 11, 42, 456, 456, 'यच्चावहासार्थमसत्कृतोऽसि

विहारशय्यासनभोजनेषु।

एकोऽथवाप्यच्युत तत्समक्षं

तत्क्षामये त्वामहमप्रमेयम्।।11.42।।', 'yach chāvahāsārtham asat-kṛito ’si
vihāra-śhayyāsana-bhojaneṣhu
eko ’tha vāpy achyuta tat-samakṣhaṁ
tat kṣhāmaye tvām aham aprameyam', '[{"word":"yat","meaning":"whatever"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"also"},{"word":"avahāsa","meaning":"artham—humorously"},{"word":"asat","meaning":"kṛitaḥ—disrespectfully"},{"word":"asi","meaning":"you were"},{"word":"vihāra","meaning":"while at play"},{"word":"śhayyā","meaning":"while resting"},{"word":"āsana","meaning":"while sitting"},{"word":"bhojaneṣhu","meaning":"while eating"},{"word":"ekaḥ","meaning":"(when) alone"},{"word":"athavā","meaning":"or"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"achyuta","meaning":"Krishna, the infallible one"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"samakṣham—before others"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"all that"},{"word":"kṣhāmaye","meaning":"beg for forgiveness"},{"word":"tvām","meaning":"from you"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"aprameyam","meaning":"immeasurable"}]'::jsonb, 'yat—whatever; cha—also; avahāsa-artham—humorously; asat-kṛitaḥ—disrespectfully; asi—you were; vihāra—while at play; śhayyā—while resting; āsana—while sitting; bhojaneṣhu—while eating; ekaḥ—(when) alone; athavā—or; api—even; achyuta—Krishna, the infallible one; tat-samakṣham—before others; tat—all that; kṣhāmaye—beg for forgiveness; tvām—from you; aham—I; aprameyam—immeasurable'),
('70f5118b-e116-5215-95a3-9d8cfeace4c9'::uuid, 11, 43, 457, 457, 'पितासि लोकस्य चराचरस्य

त्वमस्य पूज्यश्च गुरुर्गरीयान्।

न त्वत्समोऽस्त्यभ्यधिकः कुतोऽन्यो

लोकत्रयेऽप्यप्रतिमप्रभाव।।11.43।।', 'pitāsi lokasya charācharasya
tvam asya pūjyaśh cha gurur garīyān
na tvat-samo ’sty abhyadhikaḥ kuto ’nyo
loka-traye ’py apratima-prabhāva', '[{"word":"pitā","meaning":"the father"},{"word":"asi","meaning":"you are"},{"word":"lokasya","meaning":"of the entire universe"},{"word":"chara","meaning":"moving"},{"word":"acharasya","meaning":"nonmoving"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"asya","meaning":"of this"},{"word":"pūjyaḥ","meaning":"worshipable"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"guruḥ","meaning":"spiritual master"},{"word":"garīyān","meaning":"glorious"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"tvat","meaning":"samaḥ—equal to you"},{"word":"asti","meaning":"is"},{"word":"abhyadhikaḥ","meaning":"greater"},{"word":"kutaḥ","meaning":"who is?"},{"word":"anyaḥ","meaning":"other"},{"word":"loka","meaning":"traye—in the three worlds"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"apratima","meaning":"prabhāva—possessor of incomparable power"}]'::jsonb, 'pitā—the father; asi—you are; lokasya—of the entire universe; chara—moving; acharasya—nonmoving; tvam—you; asya—of this; pūjyaḥ—worshipable; cha—and; guruḥ—spiritual master; garīyān—glorious; na—not; tvat-samaḥ—equal to you; asti—is; abhyadhikaḥ—greater; kutaḥ—who is?; anyaḥ—other; loka-traye—in the three worlds; api—even; apratima-prabhāva—possessor of incomparable power'),
('419ca3cb-346d-5899-8862-253260a9d64d'::uuid, 11, 44, 458, 458, 'तस्मात्प्रणम्य प्रणिधाय कायं

प्रसादये त्वामहमीशमीड्यम्।

पितेव पुत्रस्य सखेव सख्युः

प्रियः प्रियायार्हसि देव सोढुम्।।11.44।।', 'tasmāt praṇamya praṇidhāya kāyaṁ
prasādaye tvām aham īśham īḍyam
piteva putrasya sakheva sakhyuḥ
priyaḥ priyāyārhasi deva soḍhum', '[{"word":"tasmāt","meaning":"therefore"},{"word":"praṇamya","meaning":"bowing down"},{"word":"praṇidhāya","meaning":"prostrating"},{"word":"kāyam","meaning":"the body"},{"word":"prasādaye","meaning":"to implore grace"},{"word":"tvām","meaning":"your"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"īśham","meaning":"the Supreme Lord"},{"word":"īḍyam","meaning":"adorable"},{"word":"pitā","meaning":"father"},{"word":"iva","meaning":"as"},{"word":"putrasya","meaning":"with a son"},{"word":"sakhā","meaning":"friend"},{"word":"iva","meaning":"as"},{"word":"sakhyuḥ","meaning":"with a friend"},{"word":"priyaḥ","meaning":"a lover"},{"word":"priyāyāḥ","meaning":"with the beloved"},{"word":"arhasi","meaning":"you should"},{"word":"deva","meaning":"Lord"},{"word":"soḍhum","meaning":"forgive"}]'::jsonb, 'tasmāt—therefore; praṇamya—bowing down; praṇidhāya—prostrating; kāyam—the body; prasādaye—to implore grace; tvām—your; aham—I; īśham—the Supreme Lord; īḍyam—adorable; pitā—father; iva—as; putrasya—with a son; sakhā—friend; iva—as; sakhyuḥ—with a friend; priyaḥ—a lover; priyāyāḥ—with the beloved; arhasi—you should; deva—Lord; soḍhum—forgive'),
('0b1622f1-1deb-5c1f-a72d-cd6f7baa924e'::uuid, 11, 45, 459, 459, 'अदृष्टपूर्वं हृषितोऽस्मि दृष्ट्वा

भयेन च प्रव्यथितं मनो मे।

तदेव मे दर्शय देव रूपं

प्रसीद देवेश जगन्निवास।।11.45।।', 'adṛiṣhṭa-pūrvaṁ hṛiṣhito ’smi dṛiṣhṭvā
bhayena cha pravyathitaṁ mano me
tad eva me darśhaya deva rūpaṁ
prasīda deveśha jagan-nivāsa', '[{"word":"adṛiṣhṭa","meaning":"pūrvam—that which has not been seen before"},{"word":"hṛiṣhitaḥ","meaning":"great joy"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"dṛiṣhṭvā","meaning":"having seen"},{"word":"bhayena","meaning":"with fear"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"yet"},{"word":"pravyathitam","meaning":"trembles"},{"word":"manaḥ","meaning":"mind"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"me","meaning":"to me"},{"word":"darśhaya","meaning":"show"},{"word":"deva","meaning":"Lord"},{"word":"rūpam","meaning":"form"},{"word":"prasīda","meaning":"please have mercy"},{"word":"deva","meaning":"īśha—God of gods"},{"word":"jagat","meaning":"nivāsa—abode of the universe"}]'::jsonb, 'adṛiṣhṭa-pūrvam—that which has not been seen before; hṛiṣhitaḥ—great joy; asmi—I am; dṛiṣhṭvā—having seen; bhayena—with fear; cha—yet; pravyathitam—trembles; manaḥ—mind; me—my; tat—that; eva—certainly; me—to me; darśhaya—show; deva—Lord; rūpam—form; prasīda—please have mercy; deva-īśha—God of gods; jagat-nivāsa—abode of the universe'),
('b9169044-c90a-53d0-ad81-c69e3826f833'::uuid, 11, 46, 460, 460, 'किरीटिनं गदिनं चक्रहस्त

मिच्छामि त्वां द्रष्टुमहं तथैव।

तेनैव रूपेण चतुर्भुजेन

सहस्रबाहो भव विश्वमूर्ते।।11.46।।', 'kirīṭinaṁ gadinaṁ chakra-hastam
ichchhāmi tvāṁ draṣhṭum ahaṁ tathaiva
tenaiva rūpeṇa chatur-bhujena
sahasra-bāho bhava viśhva-mūrte', '[{"word":"kirīṭinam","meaning":"wearing the crown"},{"word":"gadinam","meaning":"carrying the mace"},{"word":"chakra","meaning":"hastam—disc in hand"},{"word":"ichchhāmi","meaning":"I wish"},{"word":"tvām","meaning":"you"},{"word":"draṣhṭum","meaning":"to see"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"tathā eva","meaning":"similarly"},{"word":"tena eva","meaning":"in that"},{"word":"rūpeṇa","meaning":"form"},{"word":"chatuḥ","meaning":"bhujena—four-armed"},{"word":"sahasra","meaning":"bāho—thousand-armed one"},{"word":"bhava","meaning":"be"},{"word":"viśhwa","meaning":"mūrte—universal form"}]'::jsonb, 'kirīṭinam—wearing the crown; gadinam—carrying the mace; chakra-hastam—disc in hand; ichchhāmi—I wish; tvām—you; draṣhṭum—to see; aham—I; tathā eva—similarly; tena eva—in that; rūpeṇa—form; chatuḥ-bhujena—four-armed; sahasra-bāho—thousand-armed one; bhava—be; viśhwa-mūrte—universal form'),
('6ed28195-eb9d-5603-a951-8dfb26a5614d'::uuid, 11, 47, 461, 461, 'श्री भगवानुवाच

मया प्रसन्नेन तवार्जुनेदं

रूपं परं दर्शितमात्मयोगात्।

तेजोमयं विश्वमनन्तमाद्यं

यन्मे त्वदन्येन न दृष्टपूर्वम्।।11.47।।', 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha
mayā prasannena tavārjunedaṁ
rūpaṁ paraṁ darśhitam ātma-yogāt
tejo-mayaṁ viśhvam anantam ādyaṁ
yan me tvad anyena na dṛiṣhṭa-pūrvam', '[{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"bhagavān uvācha—the Blessed Lord said"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"prasannena","meaning":"being pleased"},{"word":"tava","meaning":"with you"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"rūpam","meaning":"form"},{"word":"param","meaning":"divine"},{"word":"darśhitam","meaning":"shown"},{"word":"ātma","meaning":"yogāt—by my Yogmaya power"},{"word":"tejaḥ","meaning":"mayam—resplendent"},{"word":"viśhwam","meaning":"cosmic"},{"word":"anantam","meaning":"unlimited"},{"word":"ādyam","meaning":"primeval"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"tvat anyena","meaning":"other than you"},{"word":"na dṛiṣhṭa","meaning":"pūrvam—no one has ever seen"}]'::jsonb, 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha—the Blessed Lord said; mayā—by me; prasannena—being pleased; tava—with you; arjuna—Arjun; idam—this; rūpam—form; param—divine; darśhitam—shown; ātma-yogāt—by my Yogmaya power; tejaḥ-mayam—resplendent; viśhwam—cosmic; anantam—unlimited; ādyam—primeval; yat—which; me—my; tvat anyena—other than you; na dṛiṣhṭa-pūrvam—no one has ever seen'),
('f7f2490b-e367-5eb8-8ca1-9cc7433265a5'::uuid, 11, 48, 462, 462, 'न वेदयज्ञाध्ययनैर्न दानै

र्न च क्रियाभिर्न तपोभिरुग्रैः।

एवंरूपः शक्य अहं नृलोके

द्रष्टुं त्वदन्येन कुरुप्रवीर।।11.48।।', 'na veda-yajñādhyayanair na dānair
na cha kriyābhir na tapobhir ugraiḥ
evaṁ-rūpaḥ śhakya ahaṁ nṛi-loke
draṣhṭuṁ tvad anyena kuru-pravīra', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"veda","meaning":"yajña—by performance of sacrifice"},{"word":"adhyayanaiḥ","meaning":"by study of the Vedas"},{"word":"na","meaning":"nor"},{"word":"dānaiḥ","meaning":"by charity"},{"word":"na","meaning":"nor"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"kriyābhiḥ","meaning":"by rituals"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"tapobhiḥ","meaning":"by austerities"},{"word":"ugraiḥ","meaning":"severe"},{"word":"evam","meaning":"rūpaḥ—in this form"},{"word":"śhakyaḥ","meaning":"possible"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"nṛi","meaning":"loke—in the world of the mortals"},{"word":"draṣhṭum","meaning":"to be seen"},{"word":"tvat","meaning":"than you"},{"word":"anyena","meaning":"by another"},{"word":"kuru","meaning":"pravīra—the best of the Kuru warriors"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; veda-yajña—by performance of sacrifice; adhyayanaiḥ—by study of the Vedas; na—nor; dānaiḥ—by charity; na—nor; cha—and; kriyābhiḥ—by rituals; na—not; tapobhiḥ—by austerities; ugraiḥ—severe; evam-rūpaḥ—in this form; śhakyaḥ—possible; aham—I; nṛi-loke—in the world of the mortals; draṣhṭum—to be seen; tvat—than you; anyena—by another; kuru-pravīra—the best of the Kuru warriors'),
('b4c8a0ce-7c71-5d0b-a6dd-75af2230647b'::uuid, 11, 49, 463, 463, 'मा ते व्यथा मा च विमूढभावो

दृष्ट्वा रूपं घोरमीदृङ्ममेदम्।

व्यपेतभीः प्रीतमनाः पुनस्त्वं

तदेव मे रूपमिदं प्रपश्य।।11.49।।', 'mā te vyathā mā cha vimūḍha-bhāvo
dṛiṣhṭvā rūpaṁ ghoram īdṛiṅ mamedam
vyapeta-bhīḥ prīta-manāḥ punas tvaṁ
